 Using the Set Operators
 --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 1. Matrix Query (Salary by Job and Department)
SQL>SELECT JOB,
       SUM(DECODE(DEPTNO,10,SAL,0)) AS DEPT10,
       SUM(DECODE(DEPTNO,20,SAL,0)) AS DEPT20,
       SUM(DECODE(DEPTNO,30,SAL,0)) AS DEPT30,
       SUM(SAL) AS TOTAL
FROM EMP
GROUP BY JOB
ORDER BY JOB;
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
output:-
------------------------------------------------------------
JOB         DEPT10 DEPT20 DEPT30 TOTAL
----------  ------ ------ ------ -----
ANALYST          0   6000      0  6000
CLERK         1300   1900    950  4150
MANAGER       2450   2975   2850  8275
PRESIDENT     5000      0      0  5000
